    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this 4-player co-op survival craft game, you and your friends are trapped inside a cursed, ever-changing board game. As members of the Mystery Club, you must uncover the secrets of Cryptfall, craft powerful tools, and defeat terrifying Cryptids to escape\u2014before the island consumes you! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590560/extras/f85c8d721935229f258137876ae9e5cf.poster.avif?t=1749889640\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590560/extras/f85c8d721935229f258137876ae9e5cf.webm?t=1749889640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources to craft powerful weapons and equipment for your journey. Build sturdy shelters to protect yourself from danger. Whether forging tools or fortifying your defenses, survival depends on your skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590560/extras/6cadfc19ba1704c6817da72f95363dc2.poster.avif?t=1749889640\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590560/extras/6cadfc19ba1704c6817da72f95363dc2.webm?t=1749889640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to four friends to increase your chances of survival\u2014or make things worse... Teamwork can turn the tide in your favor, but chaos is just a misstep away. Gather your crew and dive into the adventure together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590560/extras/67ac99025214e639497a27e0cd2aea06.poster.avif?t=1749889640\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590560/extras/67ac99025214e639497a27e0cd2aea06.webm?t=1749889640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover treasure chests hidden across the landscape, each containing valuable rewards. Uncover powerful artifacts that enhance your abilities and increase your odds of survival. Every chest you find brings you one step closer to thriving in this unforgiving world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590560/extras/16bb05e6c53365d7fa059af7059eaa1d.poster.avif?t=1749889640\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590560/extras/16bb05e6c53365d7fa059af7059eaa1d.webm?t=1749889640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss brings its own unique challenge to the fight. Defeat them, and you\u2019ll be rewarded with some awesome loot. Conquer the toughest foes and gear up for the adventures ahead! It won't be easy though...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this 4-player co-op survival craft game, you and your friends are trapped inside a cursed, ever-changing board game. As members of the Mystery Club, you must uncover the secrets of Cryptfall, craft powerful tools, and defeat terrifying Cryptids to escape\u2014before the island consumes you! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590560/extras/f85c8d721935229f258137876ae9e5cf.poster.avif?t=1749889640\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590560/extras/f85c8d721935229f258137876ae9e5cf.webm?t=1749889640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources to craft powerful weapons and equipment for your journey. Build sturdy shelters to protect yourself from danger. Whether forging tools or fortifying your defenses, survival depends on your skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590560/extras/6cadfc19ba1704c6817da72f95363dc2.poster.avif?t=1749889640\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590560/extras/6cadfc19ba1704c6817da72f95363dc2.webm?t=1749889640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to four friends to increase your chances of survival\u2014or make things worse... Teamwork can turn the tide in your favor, but chaos is just a misstep away. Gather your crew and dive into the adventure together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590560/extras/67ac99025214e639497a27e0cd2aea06.poster.avif?t=1749889640\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590560/extras/67ac99025214e639497a27e0cd2aea06.webm?t=1749889640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover treasure chests hidden across the landscape, each containing valuable rewards. Uncover powerful artifacts that enhance your abilities and increase your odds of survival. Every chest you find brings you one step closer to thriving in this unforgiving world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590560/extras/16bb05e6c53365d7fa059af7059eaa1d.poster.avif?t=1749889640\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590560/extras/16bb05e6c53365d7fa059af7059eaa1d.webm?t=1749889640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss brings its own unique challenge to the fight. Defeat them, and you\u2019ll be rewarded with some awesome loot. Conquer the toughest foes and gear up for the adventures ahead! It won't be easy though...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
